{#
/**
 * @file
 * Instructions partial.
 * 
 * This template provides a step-by-step guide for users to follow in order to access 
 * and enroll in various courses available in HRMS Learn.
 */
#}
<section id='instructions-section'>
    <h2 class='page-break-before'>Instructions</h2>
    <p>Please see the instructions below to learn how to enroll for a recommended course in HRMS Learn, and how to access the course materials once you have enrolled.</p>
    <h3>How to Enroll in a Course</h3>
    <ol>
        <li>Go to the <a href="https://hrs.example.com">HRMS Website</a> and login with your college credentials.</li>
        <li>
            Click the <strong>Learn</strong> button.
            <br>
            <img src="{{ base_path ~ module_path }}/images/hrms-learn.png" alt="HRMS Learn Button">
        </li>
        <li>
            Click the <strong>Learning Catalog</strong> tab on the bottom left corner of the website.
            <br>
            <img src="{{ base_path ~ module_path }}/images/learning-catalog.png" alt="Learning Catalog Tab">
        </li>
        <li>
            Search for <strong>Indicator 1</strong> making sure to replace the number with the indicator you are looking for.
            <br>
            <img src="{{ base_path ~ module_path }}/images/search-indicator.png" alt="Search for the Indicator number">
        </li>
        <li>
            You will see multiple courses appear, and each will include the (proficiency level) in brackets. For example:
            <br>
            <strong>Indicator 1 (Proficient): Engages with Digital Tools and Spaces Ethically and Appropriately</strong>
        </li>
        <li>
            Hover your mouse over the indicator and proficiency you are looking for, then click <strong>Enroll</strong> to add the course to your <strong>My Learning</strong> page.
            <br>
            <img src="{{ base_path ~ module_path }}/images/enroll.png" alt="Enroll Button">
        </li>
    </ol>
    <h3 class='page-break-before'>How to Access Your Recommended Course</h3>
    <ol>
        <li>
            To access your courses, click the <strong>My Learning</strong> tab on the bottom left corner of the website. You can start your courses from there!
            <br>
            <img src="{{ base_path ~ module_path }}/images/my-learning.png" alt="My Learning Tab">
        </li>
        <li>
            Click your desired course, and take care to click the right <strong>Indicator number</strong> and <strong>proficiency level</strong>. 
        </li>
        <li>
            The sections appear in bold, and the activities can be found in each section. Make sure to complete all of the activities in the recommended sections!
            <br>
            <img src="{{ base_path ~ module_path }}/images/indicator-section.png" alt="Indicator Section">
        </li>
    </ol>
</section>